        <mxCell id="notes" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;*1 &lt;b&gt;Failed at container creation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;failed to fulfil mount request: ... no such file or directory, then CrashLoopBackOff after 5 restarts in about 6 minutes. The cause was not isolated.&lt;br&gt;*2 &lt;b&gt;Scope of the observation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;2026-11-10, ap-northeast-1, one observation. Trident EKS add-on v26.6.2-eksbuild.1. iSCSI and NVMe/TCP block volumes were not tried.&lt;br&gt;*3 &lt;b&gt;What the documentation lists&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Storage with Nitro Sandboxes lists Amazon EBS, Amazon EFS, tmpfs-backed CSI drivers, and others. It does not mention NFS from third-party CSI drivers." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=#FFFFFF;fillColor=none;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=16;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
